# SCENARIO: p5_soak   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# P5 (#160) soak: 3 h with 500 bots and one real player standing at the Thais depot (bots wake around
# an observer, so the awake path runs the whole time). Pass = no crash/core, no Lua errors, the client
# stays connected (it acts every 20 min: kickIdlePlayerAfterMinutes = 30 kicked a player that only held) and keeps seeing bots move. RSS/threads are sampled on the server by p5 soak_sample.sh.
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32347,32218,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 hold 1200
@p1 face north
@p1 hold 1200
@p1 face south
@p1 hold 600
@p1 self
@srv expect-none src=srv msg~="Lua Script Error|\[error\].*(SEGV|corrupt)" within=3000
@p1 hold 1200
@p1 face north
@p1 hold 1200
@p1 face south
@p1 hold 600
@p1 self
@p1 view recent=60000
@p1 logout
